---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page current="about" title="About — It's Not Easy Being Bjorn"><div class="inner">
<img
  class="about-bjorn"
  src="/images/bjorn-about.webp"
  width="720"
  height="900"
  alt="Bjorn raises an index finger with a knowing smile."
/>
<p>
    Bjorn is a capable fellow. He builds things, fixes
    problems, and generally knows what he's doing.
    He has an unfortunate habit of saying what he thinks.
  </p>

  <p>
    Friends, neighbours, and other villagers have come to rely on him.
    Their opinions of him vary considerably.
  </p>

  <p>
    Bjorn, meanwhile, remains Bjorn.
  </p>
<hr/>
<p>
  The concepts and scripts for each strip are my own creation and work. Reluctantly, the images are generated
  with ChatGPT because I’m not a very good artist. But Bjorn deserves
  better than my stick figures &mdash; he’s dealing with enough already.
</p>
</div>
</Page>
<style>
  .about-bjorn {
    float: right;
    width: 38%;
    max-width: 280px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 0 24px 28px;
  }

  .inner::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    clear: both;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-bjorn {
      float: none;
      width: 65%;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>

